index 35f4d44..ce14985 100644
--- a/SPEC.md
+++ b/SPEC.md
@@ -2372,3 +2372,13 @@ retain cumulative usage, delivery identity and required-check policy, require
 host authentication, and be durable and idempotent. A write failure must suspend
 new dispatch. External requests do not authorize arbitrary agent-supplied host
 commands or implicit release of another product execution owner.
+
+### Optional GitHub publication admission
+
+When a GitHub provider configures `publication_guard`, agent REST writes that
+publish a branch or PR require a complete local validation receipt. The host
+resolves the immutable candidate commit tree from GitHub, then asks the configured
+guard to compare it with the current assigned workspace and environment. Local
+validation runs independently and reports start/status through `local_gate`.
+Failure, stale results, unavailable guard, or alternate mutation endpoints reject
+publication; protected remote checks continue independently.
